#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLAA = clean edges at the game's render size. DLSS = the same, and it upscales when the game's "
"Scaling is below 100 %. off = the game's own picture: use it to compare. Saved at once."
msgstr ""
"DLAA = bordes limpios al tamaño de render del juego. DLSS = lo mismo, y reescala si el Escalado "
"del juego es menor del 100 %. desactivado = la imagen propia del juego, para comparar. Se guarda "
"al instante."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Presets for your GPU. high = everything on (model 1). medium = model 2, half-size see-through "
"depth, flat mirrors without part motion, lighter part-motion search. low = also no mirror DLAA, "
"no see-through depth, VR area 60 %. Never changes a setting you set yourself."
msgstr ""
"Preajustes para tu GPU. alto = todo activado (modelo 1). medio = modelo 2, profundidad de "
"transparencias a medio tamaño, retrovisores planos sin movimiento de piezas, búsqueda de "
"movimiento más ligera. bajo = además sin DLAA de retrovisores, sin profundidad de transparencias, "
"área VR 60 %. Nunca cambia un ajuste hecho por ti."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"1 (K) = most detail, sharpest text, about 1.6x the GPU of 2. 2 (E) = balanced, least ghosting "
"behind traffic: start here. 3 (F) = calmest on fences and wires, can smear moving detail, same "
"cost as 2. 4 (M) = heaviest (about 5x), flat tests only."
msgstr ""
"1 (K) = más detalle, texto más nítido, unas 1,6x la GPU del 2. 2 (E) = equilibrado, menos estela "
"tras el tráfico: empieza aquí. 3 (F) = el más calmado en vallas y cables, puede emborronar "
"detalle en movimiento, mismo coste que el 2. 4 (M) = el más pesado (unas 5x), solo para pruebas "
"en pantalla."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Picture quality: sharpening, texture sharpness, the DLAA area and the see-through depth. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Calidad de imagen: nitidez, nitidez de texturas, área DLAA y profundidad de transparencias. "
"Derecha abre el grupo, Izquierda lo cierra; empieza cerrado cada vez que se abre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharpens the picture after DLAA, 0 (off) to 1.0. Raise it if the picture looks soft; too high "
"gives bright halos on edges. Costs about 0.1 ms; 0 skips the pass."
msgstr ""
"Aumenta la nitidez tras el DLAA, de 0 (desactivado) a 1.0. Súbela si la imagen se ve suave; "
"demasiado da halos claros en los bordes. Cuesta unos 0,1 ms; 0 se salta el paso."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How far the sharpening reaches, 1 to 4 px: small = fine detail, large = bolder edges. Change it "
"if the sharpening looks too fine or too coarse; a picture drawn larger than the screen, as in VR, "
"needs more than 1 px."
msgstr ""
"Alcance de la nitidez, de 1 a 4 px: pequeño = detalle fino, grande = bordes más marcados. "
"Cámbialo si se ve demasiado fina o gruesa; una imagen más grande que la pantalla, como en VR, "
"necesita más de 1 px."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharper texture text (road signs, dashboard, GPS). 0 = off; more negative = sharper but more "
"shimmer on fences; try -0.5 to -1 if text is blurry. No GPU time, only a little memory bandwidth."
msgstr ""
"Texto de texturas más nítido (señales, salpicadero, GPS). 0 = desactivado; más negativo = más "
"nítido pero más parpadeo en vallas; prueba -0.5 a -1 si el texto sale borroso. Sin tiempo de GPU, "
"solo algo de ancho de banda."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The same for wire fences, grass and leaf cut-outs: raise it toward 0 if fences shimmer, lower it "
"if grass looks soft. same = follows the row above. Acts only while Texture sharpness is not 0. No "
"GPU time, a little memory."
msgstr ""
"Lo mismo para vallas de alambre, hierba y recortes de hojas: sube hacia 0 si las vallas "
"parpadean, baja si la hierba se ve suave. igual = sigue la fila de arriba. Solo actúa si Nitidez "
"de texturas no es 0. Sin tiempo de GPU, algo de memoria."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR: only the middle of each eye gets DLAA (20 to 100 %); the edge keeps the game's picture. Lower "
"it to afford a heavier model or win frame rate; 40 % costs about 40 % of the model. Also sets the "
"garage / main-menu truck."
msgstr ""
"VR: solo el centro de cada ojo recibe DLAA (20 a 100 %); el borde conserva la imagen del juego. "
"Bájalo para un modelo más pesado o más fps; 40 % cuesta un 40 % del modelo. También fija el "
"camión del garaje / menú principal."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only: DLAA before the game's bloom / tonemap, so lane paint, wires and rails shimmer less. "
"Change it only to compare. Not used with DLSS upscale or Windows HDR. Same cost either way; takes "
"~60 frames to switch."
msgstr ""
"Solo pantalla: DLAA antes del bloom / tonemap del juego, para menos parpadeo en líneas, cables y "
"raíles. Cámbialo solo para comparar. No se usa con DLSS ni HDR de Windows. Mismo coste; tarda ~60 "
"fotogramas en cambiar."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives wires, fences and glass their own distance instead of what is behind them, so they do not "
"smear when you move. Turn it off if you see no smearing there: saves 0.02 - 0.06 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Da a cables, vallas y cristales su propia distancia en vez de la del fondo, para que no se "
"emborronen al moverte. Desactívalo si no ves emborronado: ahorra 0,02 - 0,06 ms por ojo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Stops street-lamp and car-light glows leaving a trail behind them when you move: DLSS takes each "
"glow from the current frame, not its history. 25 % steps; lower it if lamp glows flicker, 0 = "
"off. Costs about 0.05 - 0.2 ms per eye."
msgstr ""
"Evita que los halos de farolas y faros dejen estela al moverte: el DLSS toma cada halo del "
"fotograma actual, no del historial. Pasos de 25 %; bájalo si los halos parpadean, 0 = "
"desactivado. Cuesta unos 0,05 - 0,2 ms por ojo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How moving parts and truck mirrors are handled by DLAA. Right opens the group, Left closes it; it "
"starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Cómo trata el DLAA las piezas en movimiento y los retrovisores. Derecha abre el grupo, Izquierda "
"lo cierra; empieza cerrado cada vez que se abre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives each moving part (traffic, wheels, plates) its own motion for DLAA, so it stays sharp and "
"does not ghost. Turn it off only to save about 0.5 ms per eye or to test: every pixel then moves "
"with the camera and traffic smears."
msgstr ""
"Da a cada pieza en movimiento (tráfico, ruedas, matrículas) su propio movimiento para el DLAA: "
"queda nítida y sin estela. Desactívalo solo para ahorrar unos 0,5 ms por ojo o para probar: todo "
"se mueve con la cámara y el tráfico se emborrona."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Gives truck mirrors their own DLAA so they do not shimmer. 1 mirror = only the largest (the main "
"mirror next to you). all = every mirror. camera = cheapest per mirror, moving traffic can ghost "
"in the glass; else each part moves exactly in the glass."
msgstr ""
"Da a los retrovisores su propio DLAA contra el parpadeo. 1 retrovisor = solo el mayor (el de tu "
"lado). todos = cada retrovisor. cámara = el más barato por retrovisor, el tráfico en movimiento "
"puede dejar estela en el cristal; si no, cada pieza se mueve exacta en el cristal."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"on = each mirror gets its DLAA every 2nd frame and shows its last clean picture in between: about "
"half the mirror cost. Edges stay clean; moving things in the glass update at half rate. off = "
"every mirror every frame."
msgstr ""
"activado = cada retrovisor recibe su DLAA cada 2 fotogramas y muestra su última imagen limpia "
"entre medias: aprox. la mitad del coste. Bordes limpios; lo que se mueve en el cristal se "
"actualiza a media frecuencia. desactivado = cada retrovisor en cada fotograma."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires keep their motion while you drive: DLAA spreads the motion data over thin lines (DLSS "
"motion dilation). on = default. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more. The picture is "
"soft for a moment when it changes."
msgstr ""
"Los cables finos conservan su movimiento al conducir: el DLAA extiende los datos de movimiento "
"sobre las líneas finas (dilatación de movimiento DLSS). activado = por defecto. desactivado = "
"solo para comparar; los cables cercanos parpadean más. La imagen se suaviza un momento al cambiar."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Thin wires get depth on every pixel they touch, not only where they cover a pixel centre. on = "
"default. on (no A2C) = also for see-through edges. off = only to compare; near wires flicker more."
msgstr ""
"Los cables finos reciben profundidad en cada píxel que tocan, no solo donde cubren el centro de "
"un píxel. activado = por defecto. activado (sin A2C) = también en bordes transparentes. "
"desactivado = solo para comparar; los cables cercanos parpadean más."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental: draws far wires that are thinner than 1 pixel as a 1 pixel line, so they do not "
"break into dashes. Off by default: far wires may look darker or flicker more. Try it and compare."
msgstr ""
"Experimental: dibuja los cables lejanos más finos que 1 píxel como una línea de 1 píxel, para que "
"no se corten en rayas. Desactivado por defecto: los cables lejanos pueden verse más oscuros o "
"parpadear más. Pruébalo y compara."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS upscale, the DLAA on / off switch and the OFXR Bridge / VectorXR info. Right opens the "
"group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Escalado DLSS, el interruptor DLAA y la info de OFXR Bridge / VectorXR. Derecha abre el grupo, "
"Izquierda lo cierra; empieza cerrado cada vez que se abre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"DLSS draws the picture back up to full size when the game's Scaling is below 100 %: sharper than "
"the game's own stretch, and fewer pixels drawn means more fps. No extra cost; does nothing at "
"Scaling 100 %."
msgstr ""
"El DLSS devuelve la imagen a tamaño completo cuando el Escalado del juego es menor del 100 %: más "
"nítido que el estirado del juego, y menos píxeles dibujados = más fps. Sin coste extra; no hace "
"nada con Escalado 100 %."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Switches the whole mod on or off and keeps the mode; off shows the game's own picture, for "
"comparing. Off saves the cost of every part together."
msgstr ""
"Activa o apaga todo el mod y conserva el modo; desactivado muestra la imagen del juego, para "
"comparar. Desactivado ahorra el coste de todas las partes juntas."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"OFXR Bridge = VR frame generation by djules75, a separate download "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). found = its layer is loaded in this game and the mod lets its "
"work pass through. Start its tray app before the game."
msgstr ""
"OFXR Bridge = generación de fotogramas VR de djules75, descarga aparte "
"(github.com/djules75/OFXR-Bridge). encontrado = su capa está cargada en este juego y el mod deja "
"pasar su trabajo. Inicia su app de la bandeja antes del juego."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VectorXR = an OpenXR enhancement suite by DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, "
"Depth, frame generation; found = its layer is loaded in the game and the mod lets its work pass "
"through. Run only one Turbo (its or the mod's)."
msgstr ""
"VectorXR = suite de mejoras OpenXR de DienerTech (github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr): Turbo, Depth, "
"generación de fotogramas; encontrado = su capa está cargada en el juego y el mod deja pasar su "
"trabajo. Usa solo un Turbo (el suyo o el del mod)."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR speed-ups: Turbo, foveated rendering and the hidden area mask. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Aceleraciones VR: Turbo, renderizado foveado y máscara de área oculta. Derecha abre el grupo, "
"Izquierda lo cierra; empieza cerrado cada vez que se abre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Turbo: no ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reprojection. VR only. On = the game stops waiting for "
"the headset each frame: more fps only when the CPU is the limit (busy cities, traffic). Turn it "
"off if the picture judders. From OpenXR Toolkit."
msgstr ""
"Turbo: sin ASW / Motion Smoothing / SSW / reproyección. Solo VR. Activado = el juego deja de "
"esperar al casco en cada fotograma: más fps solo si limita la CPU (ciudades llenas, tráfico). "
"Desactívalo si la imagen da tirones. De OpenXR Toolkit."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Sharp centre, lower detail at the edge (NVIDIA RTX only). Saves GPU time at high Scaling. VR "
"only. The outer ring is shaded once per 2 x 2 pixels; fences, grass and leaves keep full detail. "
"Turn it off if the edge looks blocky."
msgstr ""
"Centro nítido, menos detalle en el borde (solo NVIDIA RTX). Ahorra GPU con Escalado alto. Solo "
"VR. El anillo exterior se sombrea una vez cada 2 x 2 píxeles; vallas, hierba y hojas conservan "
"todo el detalle. Desactívalo si el borde se ve a bloques."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How big the sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) is, 10 - 100 % in 5 % steps: bigger = more of the view "
"sharp, less saving; smaller = more saving, lower detail starts closer to the middle. 80 % "
"(balanced) is the default; 90 = wide, 65 = narrow."
msgstr ""
"Tamaño del centro nítido del Foveated (VRS), 10 - 100 % en pasos de 5 %: mayor = más vista "
"nítida, menos ahorro; menor = más ahorro, el detalle bajo empieza más cerca del centro. 80 % "
"(equilibrado) por defecto; 90 = ancho, 65 = estrecho."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Which of the game's passes Foveated (VRS) acts on. scene = the 3D world only (default). scene + "
"lighting = also the game's lighting pass, at the very edge only: more saving. Test it: look for "
"blocky light or shadow edges at the side of your view."
msgstr ""
"En qué pases del juego actúa el Foveated (VRS). escena = solo el mundo 3D (por defecto). escena + "
"iluminación = también el pase de luces, solo en el borde extremo: más ahorro. Pruébalo: busca "
"bordes de luz o sombra a bloques a los lados de la vista."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How coarse the outer ring of Foveated (VRS) is. Normal = 1 colour per 2 x 2 pixels (default). "
"Strong = per 4 x 2, Max = per 4 x 4: more GPU saving, blockier edges. Best with eye tracking, "
"where you never look at the outer ring."
msgstr ""
"Lo grueso que es el anillo exterior del Foveated (VRS). Normal = 1 color por 2 x 2 píxeles (por "
"defecto). Fuerte = por 4 x 2, Máx = por 4 x 4: más ahorro de GPU, bordes más a bloques. Ideal con "
"seguimiento ocular, donde nunca miras el anillo exterior."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Experimental. The sharp centre of Foveated (VRS) follows your eyes on a headset with eye tracking "
"(OpenXR eye gaze, for example Varjo); without one it stays at the lens centre. Needs Foveated "
"(VRS) on at the game's start, else a restart. Almost no cost."
msgstr ""
"Experimental. El centro nítido del Foveated (VRS) sigue tus ojos en un casco con seguimiento "
"ocular (mirada OpenXR, p. ej. Varjo); sin él se queda en el centro de la lente. Necesita Foveated "
"(VRS) activado al iniciar el juego, si no, reinicia. Casi sin coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. The game skips the lens corners you never see (the headset reports them), so it draws "
"fewer pixels: more GPU headroom, the picture you see stays the same. The first switch-on needs a "
"game restart. Turn it off if the edge of the view looks wrong."
msgstr ""
"Solo VR. El juego se salta las esquinas de lente que nunca ves (el casco las informa) y dibuja "
"menos píxeles: más margen de GPU, la imagen visible no cambia. La primera activación necesita "
"reiniciar el juego. Desactívalo si el borde de la vista se ve mal."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Frame rate limits and CPU: NVIDIA Reflex and an FPS cap for flat, a VR FPS cap, CPU tuning. Right "
"opens the group, Left closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Límites de fotogramas y CPU: NVIDIA Reflex y límite de fps en pantalla, límite de fps VR, ajuste "
"de CPU. Derecha abre el grupo, Izquierda lo cierra; empieza cerrado cada vez que se abre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only, NVIDIA only. On = the game's frames wait less in the GPU queue: less input lag when "
"the GPU is the limit. Boost also keeps the GPU clocks up. Same fps; small cost. Not used in VR."
msgstr ""
"Solo pantalla, solo NVIDIA. Activado = los fotogramas del juego esperan menos en la cola de la "
"GPU: menos latencia cuando limita la GPU. Boost también mantiene altos los relojes de la GPU. "
"Mismos fps; pequeño coste. No se usa en VR."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Flat only. Holds the game at most at this frame rate: a steady frame time, less heat and power. "
"Set it a bit below what your PC holds in a busy city. With Reflex on, the NVIDIA driver does the "
"limiting. off = no limit."
msgstr ""
"Solo pantalla. Mantiene el juego como máximo a esta tasa: tiempo de fotograma estable, menos "
"calor y consumo. Ponlo algo por debajo de lo que tu PC aguanta en una ciudad llena. Con Reflex "
"activado limita el controlador NVIDIA. desactivado = sin límite."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. half = the game draws every 2nd headset frame (72 Hz -> 36 fps), third = every 3rd; the "
"headset's reprojection (ASW / Motion Smoothing) fills the rest at a steady rhythm. Use it when "
"the fps swings. Turns Turbo off while on."
msgstr ""
"Solo VR. mitad = el juego dibuja uno de cada 2 fotogramas del casco (72 Hz -> 36 fps), tercio = "
"uno de cada 3; la reproyección del casco (ASW / Motion Smoothing) rellena el resto a ritmo "
"constante. Úsalo si los fps oscilan. Apaga el Turbo mientras esté activado."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Three CPU switches together: the main and render thread prefer the P-cores (Intel hybrid CPUs "
"only), the game runs at Above normal priority, and Windows may not throttle it (EcoQoS) or ignore "
"its timer requests. Helps when the CPU is the limit; no cost. Separate settings in dlaa.ini: "
"cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."
msgstr ""
"Tres interruptores de CPU juntos: los hilos principal y de render prefieren los P-cores (solo CPU "
"híbridas Intel), el juego corre con prioridad Superior a la normal, y Windows no lo limita "
"(EcoQoS) ni ignora sus temporizadores. Ayuda si limita la CPU; sin coste. Ajustes por separado en "
"dlaa.ini: cpu_pcore, cpu_priority, cpu_no_throttle."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The panel's position, size, depth, facing and the menu keys. Right opens the group, Left closes "
"it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Posición, tamaño, profundidad y orientación del panel y las teclas del menú. Derecha abre el "
"grupo, Izquierda lo cierra; empieza cerrado cada vez que se abre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = the panel moves with the headset. Fixed in cab = it stays at one spot in "
"front of your seat, steady while you look around; X / Y / depth then set that spot (degrees, "
"metres). Needs the VR layer (default). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Solo VR. Sigue la cabeza = el panel se mueve con el casco. Fijo en cabina = queda en un punto "
"frente a tu asiento, estable al mirar alrededor; X / Y / profundidad fijan ese punto (grados, "
"metros). Necesita la capa VR (por defecto). Sin coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees around your seat). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Mueve este panel de lado, en % de la pantalla (VR fijo en cabina: grados alrededor del asiento). "
"Pantalla y VR guardan cada uno su posición. Úsalo si el panel tapa algo que necesitas. Sin coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves this panel up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed in cab: degrees, plus = down). Flat and "
"VR each keep their own position. Use it if the panel covers something you need. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Mueve este panel arriba / abajo, en % de la pantalla (VR fijo en cabina: grados, más = abajo). "
"Pantalla y VR guardan cada uno su posición. Úsalo si el panel tapa algo que necesitas. Sin coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes this panel bigger or smaller. Raise it if you cannot read it, lower it if it covers too "
"much. Flat and VR each keep their own size. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Hace este panel más grande o pequeño. Súbelo si no lo puedes leer, bájalo si tapa demasiado. "
"Pantalla y VR guardan cada uno su tamaño. Sin coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the panel floats: in metres (0.30 - 3.00) as a VR layer, "
"the default; in px of inward shift per eye with menu_vr_layer = 0. Same size at every depth. "
"Change it if the panel is tiring to look at. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Solo VR, por eso gris en pantalla. A qué distancia flota el panel: en metros (0.30 - 3.00) como "
"capa VR, el valor por defecto; en px de desplazamiento hacia dentro por ojo con menu_vr_layer = "
"0. Mismo tamaño a toda profundidad. Cámbialo si el panel cansa la vista. Sin coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. On = the panel turns to face you when you move it to the side, same "
"size from every angle (as a VR layer, the default, the head-following fps box too); off = a flat "
"picture. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Solo VR, por eso gris en pantalla. Activado = el panel se gira hacia ti al moverlo de lado, mismo "
"tamaño desde todo ángulo (como capa VR, por defecto, también el cuadro de fps que sigue la "
"cabeza); desactivado = imagen plana. Sin coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"A small live fps and frame-time box, also while this menu is closed (flat and VR). Use it to see "
"what a setting gains. Its GPU cost is measured: per frame, every picture it is drawn into; none "
"when off. Save keeps it for the next start."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño cuadro en vivo de fps y tiempo de fotograma, también con este menú cerrado (pantalla y "
"VR). Sirve para ver qué gana un ajuste. Su coste de GPU se mide: por fotograma, cada imagen donde "
"se dibuja; ninguno si está desactivado. Guardar lo conserva al próximo inicio."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The fps box's lock, position, size, colour, VR distance and turn. Right opens the group, Left "
"closes it; it starts closed every time the menu opens."
msgstr ""
"Bloqueo, posición, tamaño, color, distancia VR y giro del cuadro de fps. Derecha abre el grupo, "
"Izquierda lo cierra; empieza cerrado cada vez que se abre el menú."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only. Follow head = moves with the headset. Fixed in play space = one spot around your seat, "
"ignores the cab's sway. Attached to vehicle = stuck to the cab, sways with it (needs DLAA + "
"Per-part motion vectors). No cost."
msgstr ""
"Solo VR. Sigue la cabeza = se mueve con el casco. Fijo en el espacio de juego = un punto "
"alrededor del asiento, ignora el balanceo de la cabina. Unido al vehículo = pegado a la cabina, "
"se balancea con ella (necesita DLAA + Vectores de movimiento por pieza). Sin coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. On = each truck / car keeps its own fps box spot in the cab, turn, "
"size, colour, brightness and text (saved in dlaa.ini when the menu closes). Off = one shared set "
"for every vehicle. No cost."
msgstr ""
"VR, solo Unido al vehículo. Activado = cada camión / coche conserva el sitio de su cuadro de fps "
"en la cabina, giro, tamaño, color, brillo y texto (se guarda en dlaa.ini al cerrar el menú). "
"Desactivado = un solo conjunto para todos los vehículos. Sin coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR, Attached to vehicle only. Right = measure the cab again now (sit still, parked) if the box "
"sits off. Left = this vehicle's box back to the defaults (spot, turn, size, colour, text); other "
"vehicles keep theirs. The box is square to the cab."
msgstr ""
"VR, solo Unido al vehículo. Derecha = medir la cabina de nuevo ahora (quieto, aparcado) si el "
"cuadro está descolocado. Izquierda = cuadro de este vehículo a los valores por defecto (sitio, "
"giro, tamaño, color, texto); los demás vehículos conservan los suyos. El cuadro queda en escuadra "
"con la cabina."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box sideways, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees around you). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Mueve el cuadro de fps de lado, en % de la pantalla (VR fijo / unido: grados alrededor de ti). "
"Pantalla y VR guardan cada uno su posición. Sin coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Moves the fps box up / down, in % of the screen (VR fixed / attached: degrees, minus = up). Flat "
"and VR each keep their own position. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Mueve el cuadro de fps arriba / abajo, en % de la pantalla (VR fijo / unido: grados, menos = "
"arriba). Pantalla y VR guardan cada uno su posición. Sin coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Turns the fps box left / right on itself, in degrees (+ = its face "
"turns to the right). Use it to angle the box when it sits at the side. 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Solo VR, por eso gris en pantalla. Gira el cuadro de fps sobre sí mismo a izquierda / derecha, en "
"grados (+ = su cara gira a la derecha). Úsalo para angularlo cuando está de lado. 0 = te mira de "
"frente. Sin coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Tilts the fps box, in degrees (+ = its top leans away from you, as if "
"lying on the dashboard). 0 = it faces you. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Solo VR, por eso gris en pantalla. Inclina el cuadro de fps, en grados (+ = su parte alta se "
"aleja de ti, como tumbado en el salpicadero). 0 = te mira de frente. Sin coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. Rotates the fps box in its own plane, in degrees (+ = clockwise). 0 = "
"upright. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Solo VR, por eso gris en pantalla. Rota el cuadro de fps en su propio plano, en grados (+ = "
"sentido horario). 0 = derecho. Sin coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Makes the fps box bigger or smaller (0.2 .. 3.0). Raise it if you cannot read it in the headset "
"or on a big screen. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Hace el cuadro de fps más grande o pequeño (0.2 .. 3.0). Súbelo si no lo lees en el casco o en "
"una pantalla grande. Sin coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The colour of the fps box's text: 20 colours, each with an outline so it reads on any picture "
"(black on white = dark text, white outline). Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Color del texto del cuadro de fps: 20 colores, cada uno con contorno para leerse sobre cualquier "
"imagen (negro sobre blanco = texto oscuro, contorno blanco). Pantalla y VR. Sin coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How bright the fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = the colour as it is, lower dims the text (the "
"outline stays) toward black. Use it to tone the counter down at night or in the headset. Flat and "
"VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Brillo del cuadro de fps, 10 - 100 %: 100 = el color tal cual, más bajo oscurece el texto (el "
"contorno se queda) hacia el negro. Úsalo para atenuar el contador de noche o en el casco. "
"Pantalla y VR. Sin coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"How see-through the whole fps box is, 10 - 100 %: 100 = solid, lower fades the text AND its black "
"outline together, so a dimmed box does not turn into a black blob. Flat and VR. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Transparencia de todo el cuadro de fps, 10 - 100 %: 100 = sólido, más bajo desvanece el texto Y "
"su contorno negro a la vez, así un cuadro atenuado no se vuelve una mancha negra. Pantalla y VR. "
"Sin coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"VR only, so greyed in flat. How far away the fps box floats, 0.30 - 3.00 m. It keeps the same "
"size in your view at every distance; only the depth changes. Put it near the depth you look at to "
"read it without refocusing. No cost."
msgstr ""
"Solo VR, por eso gris en pantalla. A qué distancia flota el cuadro de fps, 0.30 - 3.00 m. "
"Mantiene el mismo tamaño en tu vista a toda distancia; solo cambia la profundidad. Ponlo a la "
"profundidad en que miras para leerlo sin reenfocar. Sin coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"What goes into dlaa_inject.log: off = nothing; errors = failures only (default); warnings = + "
"problems worked around; info = + start-up and changes; debug = + statistics, and debug also runs "
"the GPU timers and the CPU profiler."
msgstr ""
"Qué va a dlaa_inject.log: desactivado = nada; errores = solo fallos (por defecto); avisos = + "
"problemas sorteados; info = + inicio y cambios; depuración = + estadísticas, y depuración también "
"activa los temporizadores de GPU y el perfilador de CPU."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"The language of this menu. auto = the game's language (default); Left / Right picks another one. "
"Linux / Proton: Chinese, Japanese and Korean need their fonts installed, see the README. A "
"lang\\<code>.po file next to the DLL wins, for your own fixes. Save keeps it. No cost."
msgstr ""
"El idioma de este menú. auto = el del juego (por defecto); Izquierda / Derecha elige otro. Linux "
"/ Proton: chino, japonés y coreano necesitan sus fuentes, mira el README. Un archivo "
"lang\\<code>.po junto a la DLL tiene prioridad, para tus correcciones. Guardar lo conserva. Sin "
"coste."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Every hotkey of this menu, one line per action, with its keyboard key and controller button. "
"Right opens the list; pick an action with Right, then press the new key or wheel button. Saved to "
"dlaa.ini at once."
msgstr ""
"Todas las teclas de este menú, una línea por acción, con su tecla de teclado y botón de mando. "
"Derecha abre la lista; elige una acción con Derecha y pulsa la nueva tecla o botón del volante. "
"Se guarda al instante en dlaa.ini."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Writes everything shown here into dlaa.ini (settings, and the panel / fps box positions once you "
"moved them), keeping every other line. Do it once you like what you see, or the changes are gone "
"at the next start. Mode saves itself."
msgstr ""
"Escribe todo lo mostrado aquí en dlaa.ini (ajustes, y posiciones del panel / cuadro de fps una "
"vez movidos), conservando las demás líneas. Hazlo cuando te guste lo que ves, o los cambios se "
"pierden al próximo inicio. El modo se guarda solo."

#. Description of the selected row (up to 4 lines together with the cost sentence)
#: src/inject.cpp
msgid ""
"Puts every setting in this menu back to how the mod ships (model, sharpen, texture sharpness, "
"DLAA area, motion, mirrors, profile, panel, fps box, turbo, foveated, frame rate, logging), live "
"and in dlaa.ini, keeping your hotkeys and every other line."
msgstr ""
"Devuelve cada ajuste de este menú a como viene el mod (modelo, nitidez, nitidez de texturas, área "
"DLAA, movimiento, retrovisores, perfil, panel, cuadro de fps, turbo, Foveated, fotogramas, "
"registro), en vivo y en dlaa.ini, conservando tus teclas y las demás líneas."

