"%.1f, mirrors %.1f, sharpen %.1f, copies %.1f"
msgstr ""
"este mod: %lc%ls%lc | %lc%ls%lc ms -- GPU: NGX %.1f, mov. piezas %.1f, cámara %.1f, "
"transparencias %.1f, retrovisores %.1f, nitidez %.1f, copias %.1f"

#. Performance line at the top (one line, small font)
